<section class="education" id="guidance">
<div class="container">

<div class="center">

<span class="eyebrow">Real Estate Knowledge</span>

<h2 class="section-title">
Important Things to Verify Before Buying Land
</h2>

<p class="section-description">
A successful property search begins with reliable information.
These are some of the essential aspects buyers should
review before entering into a property transaction.
</p>

</div>

<div class="education-grid">

<div class="education-card reveal">
<div class="education-icon">▤</div>

<h3>Ownership & Title Verification</h3>

<p>
Review the property's ownership records, transaction
history, encumbrances and relevant land documents.
Independent legal review is strongly recommended.
</p>
</div>

<div class="education-card reveal">
<div class="education-icon">⌖</div>

<h3>Location & Accessibility</h3>

<p>
Confirm the plot's survey details, boundaries,
actual road access, distance from important
landmarks and connectivity during different seasons.
</p>
</div>

<div class="education-card reveal">
<div class="education-icon">▥</div>

<h3>Land Use & Permissions</h3>

<p>
Understand whether the land is legally classified
for residential, commercial, agricultural or other use.
Future construction may require separate permissions.
</p>
</div>

<div class="education-card reveal">
<div class="education-icon">◈</div>

<h3>Development Status</h3>

<p>
Distinguish between officially approved infrastructure,
projects under construction and proposed developments.
Do not assume every announced facility is operational.
</p>
</div>

<div class="education-card reveal">
<div class="education-icon">₹</div>

<h3>Total Purchase Cost</h3>

<p>
Compare the quoted land price with stamp duty,
registration fees, taxes, maintenance charges,
legal expenses and any other applicable costs.
</p>
</div>

<div class="education-card reveal">
<div class="education-icon">✓</div>

<h3>Independent Due Diligence</h3>

<p>
Use appropriate legal and financial professionals
to evaluate the property. Real estate prices can
fluctuate, and future appreciation is never guaranteed.
</p>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</section>

